</Column></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1320"><Container width="1104" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="24"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#2563EB" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="1">布局自检</Text><SizedBox height="8"/><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="22" color="#334155">先看根 Container 是否固定尺寸，再看每个 Expanded 的主轴是否有界；用实际 PNG 检查文字是否被裁剪。</Text></Column></Container></Positioned>
